{
  "uid": "v2-mirrors",
  "title": "v2 · Mirrors — replay + comparator + DLQ + fan-out",
  "tags": ["packiot-v2", "mirror-worker", "replay", "comparator", "retires-at-flip"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### mirror-worker — prod (SELECT-only) → staging replay/fan-out, plus the comparator watchdog\nJob **`mirror-worker`** (Prometheus `packiot-prometheus`). It replays prod `user_logs`, fans equipment values out to the shadow flows, and continuously compares the legacy vs Go OEE. Every tile here is a live-verified metric; **0 reads as healthy** on lag / DLQ / divergence / error panels. This board **retires at flip R1** — once the shadow flows are cut over there is nothing left to mirror."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cursor lag behind prod",
      "description": "mirror_worker_cursor_lag_seconds — how far replay trails the prod user_logs tip. Near 0 = caught up.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 120 }, { "color": "red", "value": 600 } ] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "max(mirror_worker_cursor_lag_seconds)", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "DLQ depth",
      "description": "mirror_worker_dlq_depth — replay dead-letters awaiting retry. 0 = healthy; a sustained climb = replays failing faster than they drain.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 25 } ] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "max(mirror_worker_dlq_depth)", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Comparator active-POs diff",
      "description": "mirror_worker_comparator_active_pos_diff — count of production orders the legacy and Go flows disagree are 'active' right now. 0 = the two flows see the same live POs.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 5 } ] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "max(mirror_worker_comparator_active_pos_diff)", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reconciler active drift POs",
      "description": "mirror_worker_reconciler_active_drift_pos — POs the reconciler still has to pull back into alignment. 0 = reconciled; this is the backlog the reconciler is working down.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 10 } ] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "max(mirror_worker_reconciler_active_drift_pos)", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "user_logs replay rate by outcome (ok / failed / skipped)",
      "description": "sum by(outcome) rate(mirror_worker_user_logs_replayed_total[5m]). ok carries the traffic; failed should stay flat 0; skipped is expected for no-op categories.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "failed" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(mirror_worker_user_logs_replayed_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Replay duration p95",
      "description": "histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(mirror_worker_replay_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])). How long a single replay takes at the 95th percentile — a rising p95 precedes cursor lag.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(mirror_worker_replay_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))", "legendFormat": "p95", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DLQ retry attempts by outcome (healthy = flat / all ok)",
      "description": "sum by(outcome) rate(mirror_worker_dlq_retry_attempts_total[5m]). Retries firing at all means something dead-lettered; a rising failed line means it can't be re-driven.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "auto" } }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "failed" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(mirror_worker_dlq_retry_attempts_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Comparator runs by outcome (the watchdog heartbeat)",
      "description": "sum by(outcome) rate(mirror_worker_comparator_runs_total[5m]). ok = the comparator is actively checking; a flatline to 0 means the watchdog itself stopped (a silent-blindness risk, not a pass).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "error" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(mirror_worker_comparator_runs_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Comparator OEE divergence % per active PO (0 = flows agree — THE correctness signal)",
      "description": "mirror_worker_comparator_oee_divergence_pct{id_production_order}. Each line is one live PO; 0% means legacy and Go computed the same OEE. Any sustained non-zero line is a real correctness gap and blocks the flip.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 6, "showPoints": "auto" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 } ] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "mirror_worker_comparator_oee_divergence_pct", "legendFormat": "PO {{id_production_order}}", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Comparator lags — events + user_logs (seconds behind)",
      "description": "mirror_worker_comparator_events_lag_seconds and mirror_worker_comparator_user_logs_lag. How far the comparator's view of each stream trails live. Low = the comparison is looking at fresh data.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "max(mirror_worker_comparator_events_lag_seconds)", "legendFormat": "events lag", "refId": "A" },
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "max(mirror_worker_comparator_user_logs_lag)", "legendFormat": "user_logs lag", "refId": "B" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Value fan-out rate by destination × outcome",
      "description": "sum by(destination,outcome) rate(mirror_worker_value_fanout_total[5m]). The ok lines for each shadow destination fan out from the same loop and should track each other; any non-ok line is a dropped fan-out (loss-with-alert contract).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 33 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*(error|failed|nack).*" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (destination, outcome) (rate(mirror_worker_value_fanout_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{destination}} · {{outcome}}", "refId": "A" } ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reconciler sync rate — values + events by outcome (healthy = ok only)",
      "description": "rate(mirror_worker_reconciler_values_synced_total[5m]) and rate(mirror_worker_reconciler_events_total[5m]), split by outcome. These are the reconciler's corrective writes; a non-ok line is a reconcile that itself failed.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 41 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*(error|failed).*" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(mirror_worker_reconciler_values_synced_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "values · {{outcome}}", "refId": "A" },
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(mirror_worker_reconciler_events_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "events · {{outcome}}", "refId": "B" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
